<title>UK: Glaxo unit sets $350 mln five-year bond. [CORRECTED 12:26 GMT]</title>
<headline>Glaxo unit sets $350 mln five-year bond. [CORRECTED 12:26 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers CSFB and Dai-ichi Kangyo Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GLAXO KK</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  Glaxo Wellcome Plc (RATED AA3/AA)</p>
<p> AMT    $350 MLN	COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    02.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.025   PAY DATE    02.MAY.97</p>
<p>(Corrects PAY DATE date from 01.MAY.97)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.425    SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.625 PCT FIVE-YEAR U.S TREASURY -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
